---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dhruv Patel - Lead Android Engineer"
  description="Dhruv Patel - Lead Android Engineer, Android Architect, and Android Artist crafting high-performance native architectures, on-device AI runtimes, and low-level hardware interfaces."
>
  <div class="layout-container-wide" style="padding-top: var(--space-8); padding-bottom: var(--space-16);">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="card hero-panel">
      <img
        src="/images/pro_pic_small.jpg"
        alt="Dhruv Patel"
        width="180"
        height="180"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="hero-avatar"
      />
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <span class="badge">Lead Android Engineer</span>
          <span class="chip">Battle-Tested Leadership</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="page-title hero-title" style="margin: 0;">Dhruv Patel</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-small); color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0;">
          Android Architect &middot; Android Artist &middot; On-Device AI
        </p>
        <p class="page-lead hero-lead" style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          I'm a Lead Android Engineer, Android Architect, and Android Artist. I work on the parts of software that get interesting when they hit real device constraints: performance profiling, low-level hardware interfaces, and running local AI models on personal devices without cloud dependencies.
        </p>
        <div class="layout-cluster hero-actions" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
          <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-primary">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Explore Portfolio</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Featured Projects</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            <span>AI Engineering Series</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17l9.2-9.2M17 17V7H7"/></svg>
            <span>Résumé (PDF)</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 1: CORE CAPABILITIES -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Engineering Domains
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Specialization & Technical Focus</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          The technical areas where I spend most of my time, from native Android internals to cross-platform runtimes and low-level device hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-2">
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Domain 01</span>
            <span class="badge">Battle-Tested</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Android & Native Architecture</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Production Clean Architecture, unidirectional data flow (MVI/MVVM), Jetpack Compose, modular multi-module codebases, memory profiling, and battery guardrails.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            <span class="chip">Kotlin</span>
            <span class="chip">Jetpack Compose</span>
            <span class="chip">Coroutines/Flow</span>
            <span class="chip">NDK / C++20</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: var(--space-1); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> <span>Explore Architecture</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/projects/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Domain 02</span>
            <span class="badge">Production</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP/CMP)</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Cross-platform architecture sharing deterministic game loops, MVI state stores, and offline-first persistence across Android, iOS (SwiftUI host), and Android TV.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            <span class="chip">Compose Multiplatform</span>
            <span class="chip">SQLDelight</span>
            <span class="chip">Cloud Firestore</span>
            <span class="chip">Swift Interop</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: var(--space-1); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> <span>Explore Projects</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Domain 03</span>
            <span class="badge">Offline-First</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">On-Device AI & Edge Compute</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Local LLM inference and on-device diffusion studios (llama.cpp, LiteRT, Apple MLX) running on consumer phones with speculative drafting and defensive driver crash sandboxing.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            <span class="chip">Image Generation</span>
            <span class="chip">llama.cpp</span>
            <span class="chip">Google LiteRT</span>
            <span class="chip">Apple MLX</span>
            <span class="chip">Stable Diffusion</span>
            <span class="chip">Vulkan / Metal</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: var(--space-1); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> <span>Explore AI Series</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/portfolio/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Domain 04</span>
            <span class="badge">Enterprise</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Commerce & Hardware Integration</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Digital commerce flows, payment terminal protocols, and resilient hardware abstraction layers across 30+ POS peripherals with defensive IPC.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            <span class="chip">POS Peripherals</span>
            <span class="chip">Payment IPC</span>
            <span class="chip">HAL Bridges</span>
            <span class="chip">Zero Cloud Leak</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: var(--space-1); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;">
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> <span>Explore Systems</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: SELECTED WORK -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Featured Work
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Selected Production Systems</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          Real-world applications and native libraries engineered for performance, resilience, and privacy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-2">
        <!-- AI Playground -->
        <article class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
              <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">System 01</span>
              <span class="badge">Flagship &middot; On-Device AI</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">
              <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="card-stretched-link" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                AI Playground
              </a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            An offline-first multimodal AI workstation that runs local LLMs and diffusion models directly on mobile silicon—keeping user conversations and documents private without cloud round-trips. Built with Kotlin Multiplatform, C++20 JNI bindings to llama.cpp, Google AI Edge LiteRT, and Apple MLX. Includes dual-model speculative drafting (2x speedup) and a native <code>fork()</code> sandbox to isolate Vulkan driver crashes.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
            <span class="chip">KMP</span>
            <span class="chip">Compose MP</span>
            <span class="chip">Image Generation</span>
            <span class="chip">C++20 NDK</span>
            <span class="chip">llama.cpp</span>
            <span class="chip">Vulkan/Metal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deardhruv.llmplayground" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 3.71v16.58a0.7.7 0 0 0 1.057.606l14.35-8.29a0.7.7 0 0 0 0-1.214L5.057 3.104A.7.7 0 0 0 4 3.71z"/>
                <path d="M15 12 4.5 21.5"/>
                <path d="M4.5 2.5 15 12"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Google Play</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/DearDhruv/Model-Playground" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/>
              </svg>
              <span>GitHub</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="btn btn-secondary">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Read Series</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- VelociHue -->
        <article class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
              <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">System 02</span>
              <span class="badge">Flagship &middot; Multiplatform Game</span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">
              <a href="/projects/" class="card-stretched-link" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                VelociHue
              </a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            A fast-paced arcade action game engineered in Kotlin Multiplatform and Compose Multiplatform for Android, iOS, and Android TV. Runs at 60–120 FPS using a shared deterministic physics loop, conflict-free Cloud Firestore schema v5 sync with 3-way union merge, and 29 progressive achievements.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
            <span class="chip">KMP</span>
            <span class="chip">Compose MP</span>
            <span class="chip">Cloud Firestore</span>
            <span class="chip">Android TV</span>
            <span class="chip">SDK 37</span>
          </div>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deardhruv.velocihue" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 3.71v16.58a0.7.7 0 0 0 1.057.606l14.35-8.29a0.7.7 0 0 0 0-1.214L5.057 3.104A.7.7 0 0 0 4 3.71z"/>
                <path d="M15 12 4.5 21.5"/>
                <path d="M4.5 2.5 15 12"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Google Play</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-secondary">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
              <span>Case Study</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); text-align: center;">
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          <span>View Full Portfolio &amp; Case Studies</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: TECHNICAL WRITING SPOTLIGHT -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Engineering Series
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Beyond the Model: AI Playground Engineering Series</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          A six-part architectural log documenting the realities of running local LLMs, image generation, and document processing directly on mobile hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-3">
        <!-- Part 1 -->
        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/01-i-wanted-the-model-to-stay-on-the-phone/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Part 1 of 6</span>
            <span class="chip" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">10 min</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Offline Local LLMs</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Architecting offline-first mobile inference, setting up speculative drafting with smaller models, and managing VRAM limits on mobile silicon.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); padding-top: var(--space-3);">
            <span class="badge">Architecture</span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;"><span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> Read</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Part 2 -->
        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/02-the-day-a-chat-box-became-a-document-engine/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Part 2 of 6</span>
            <span class="chip" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">9 min</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Offline Document Engine</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            How a simple 'attach file' button turned into an offline ingestion pipeline for 25+ formats using pure RFC 1951 Deflate and memory-mapped chunks.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); padding-top: var(--space-3);">
            <span class="badge">Deflate / KMP</span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;"><span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> Read</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Part 3 -->
        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/03-the-model-was-fine-the-phone-wasnt/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Part 3 of 6</span>
            <span class="chip" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">10 min</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Defensive Crash Isolation</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Handling vendor Vulkan driver GPU segmentation faults by running inference inside a native <code>fork()</code> process sandbox with a 3000ms watchdog loop.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); padding-top: var(--space-3);">
            <span class="badge">NDK / C++20</span>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 600;"><span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span> Read</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Part 4 -->
        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/04-i-put-an-image-generator-inside-the-phone/" class="card card-interactive" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">Part 4 of 6</span>
            <span class="chip" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">11 min</span>
          </div>
